config MT6628
	tristate "MediaTek MT6628 SDIO"
	depends on MMC && MAC80211
	select CRC32
	select FW_LOADER
	select REGMAP
	help
	  Station-only legacy 2.4 GHz support for MediaTek MT6628 SDIO devices.
	  Uses mac80211 management with vendor firmware.
	  This driver is under development.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here. The module
	  will be called mt6628.
